title: "Publication-aware tectonic classification of global basalts"
type: software
abstract: "Reproducible data-processing, publication-grouped validation, temporal testing, source-coverage analysis, model artefacts, and figure-generation resources for global basalt tectonic classification. The MIT licence applies only to original software. GEOROC-derived processed data and figures are subject to CC BY-SA 4.0, while PetDB-derived measurements remain subject to EarthChem and original source-record terms as documented in DATA_LICENSE.md."
